    "title": "Over 600 Taken Into Custody In Massive Northern Ohio Law Enforcement Sweep - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jessica Bowling ,\n10 hours ago A concerted, multi-agency summer blitz in eight northern Ohio cities resulted in 619 arrests, the clearance of 684 warrants, and the seizure of roughly 200 firearms, federal officials reported. The joint initiative, dubbed Operation Northern Shield, targeted violent fugitives from May 17 through July 18 in Akron, Canton, Cleveland, Elyria,... Read full article\n15",
